WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.360
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:06.590
We are Pongfinity and welcome to another episode
of Challenge Pongfinity!

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:11.280
This is the series where YOU challenge US
with your craziest ideas related to table

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.280
tennis.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.759
We will go through all of your comments, pick
the most creative ones and make a video out

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:16.380
of them.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.540
If your comment gets picked, we will give
you a shout out and feature it in the next

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.040
video.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.280
So leave your comments in the comment-section
below!

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.840
Gronkh Yoshi wants me to block 5 times with
my foot.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:33.260
So, let's play some foot table tennis!

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:12.480
The TWY Channel wants us to play a 10 shot
topspin rally with penhold.

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.540
This one is from Julian 47.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.360
Try to make 3 behind the back around the net
shots in a row.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.120
Okay Julian, let's do it!

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.820
Gary Garner wants us to make a cart wheel
table tennis shot.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:40.520
Kiro Emad wants us to play with 2 balls

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.300
And the other one has to do around the back
shots

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.790
And the other one has to do between the leg
shots.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.750
Miikka, you can do the around the back shots.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.620
And I will do the between the legs shots.

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.300
Let's go!

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:21.880
Crave is asking, is it possible to buy Pongfinity
t-shirts?

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:25.860
As a matter of fact, we have just opened up
our Pongfinity merchandize store.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:30.200
So now you can, indeed, be one of the first
people ever to buy and get yourself one of

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.220
these!

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.240
Or, one of these!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.600
You can find the store at

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:37.280
www.printmotor.com/pongfinity

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:40.000
And there is a link in the description below.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:44.080
Make sure you check it out and get your own
t-shirts and hoodies.

